        "jsCode": "// Get all items from the previous node\nconst allItems = $input.all();\nconst data = allItems.map(item => item.json);\n\n// Sort the data\ndata.sort((a, b) => {\n    // 1. Resolve the values using your priority list: receivedAt -> createdAt -> id\n    const valA = a.receivedAt || a.createdAt || a.id;\n    const valB = b.receivedAt || b.createdAt || b.id;\n\n    // 2. Convert to timestamps for comparison if possible\n    const timeA = new Date(valA).getTime() || 0;\n    const timeB = new Date(valB).getTime() || 0;\n\n    // 3. Sort Descending (Newest/Latest first)\n    // If times are valid (dates), subtract them. \n    // If times are not valid (IDs), compare them as strings.\n    if (timeA !== 0 && timeB !== 0) {\n        return timeB - timeA; \n    } else {\n        return valB > valA ? 1 : -1;\n    }\n});\n\n// Return the sorted rows to Retool\nreturn { rows: data };"
